Install the conformance-comment workflow from siros-conformance.

Comment `@conformance` on any PR to trigger OpenID conformance tests.

### Usage

```
@conformance                          # all profiles, :latest images
@conformance wallet                   # wallet profile only  
@conformance go-wallet-backend:pr-42  # auto-detect profile, override image
```

### Prerequisites

- `CONFORMANCE_DISPATCH_TOKEN` secret must be configured (fine-grained PAT with Contents read/write on `siros-conformance`)

